<p>{{ site.name }} is an informational news site. It is not an investment adviser. Advertising, if it is shown later, is separate from reporting. We do not accept payment for a news article. If that ever changes, the article will say so in the story itself.</p>
<p>Google AdSense is not loaded until a publisher id is set in the site configuration. Until then, pages do not request ads, and <a href="{{ '/ads.txt' | url }}">ads.txt</a> is a placeholder. When a publisher id is set, the site may show ads through Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies to serve those ads. Google describes that use in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads">How Google uses cookies in advertising</a>. Visitors in the European Union, the United Kingdom, and Switzerland see a consent choice through Google’s Privacy &amp; messaging tools. We do not add a separate consent-banner script. The same account of advertising is in the <a href="{{ '/privacy/' | url }}">privacy policy</a>.</p>
<p>An ad is not a recommendation from {{ site.name }} and it is not investment advice. Read the <a href="{{ '/disclaimer/' | url }}">disclaimer</a>.</p>
